{"id":"n73140-2-7","stage":5,"title":"잡아내다 · 揪出来","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n73140-2-7-1","ko":"범인이 어디로 숨었는지 알 수가 없어요.","zh":"我不知道凶手躲去了哪里。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"범인이","meaning":"犯人，罪犯","explanation":"범인：犯人，罪犯；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"범인","audio":"/audio/29d23f06ebca35bda654.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14455","senseId":"1","lemma":"범인","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어디로","meaning":"哪里，哪儿","explanation":"어디：哪里，哪儿；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"어디","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60319","senseId":"3","lemma":"어디","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"숨었는지","meaning":"躲藏，隐藏","explanation":"숨다：躲藏，隐藏；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；는지：引入未确定的信息、间接疑问或选择：“是否、怎么、何时”等。","readings":[{"term":"숨다","audio":"/audio/09d4842abe38510efe93.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"63498","senseId":"1","lemma":"숨다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"알","meaning":"知道，明白","explanation":"알다：知道，明白；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"알다","audio":"/audio/4646a3463436c8a43feb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89445","senseId":"1","lemma":"알다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"수가","meaning":"可以，可能","explanation":"수：可以，可能；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"수","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15615","senseId":"1","lemma":"수","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"없어요.","meaning":"不能（-ㄹ/을 수 없다）","explanation":"없다：不能（-ㄹ/을 수 없다）；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"없다","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89917","senseId":"11","lemma":"없다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"29d23f06ebca35bd","term":"범인","zh":"犯人，罪犯","audio":"/audio/29d23f06ebca35bda654.mp3","entryId":"14455","definition":"违反法律、犯了错误的人。","pronunciation":["버ː민"]},{"id":"c1ee1b7e560f9f3a","term":"어디","zh":"哪里，哪儿","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3","entryId":"60319","definition":"指代不确定的或难以准确表述的某个处所。","pronunciation":["어디"]},{"id":"09d4842abe38510e","term":"숨다","zh":"躲藏，隐藏","audio":"/audio/09d4842abe38510efe93.mp3","entryId":"63498","definition":"隐藏身体，使别人看不到。","pronunciation":["숨ː따"]},{"id":"4646a3463436c8a4","term":"알다","zh":"知道，明白","audio":"/audio/4646a3463436c8a43feb.mp3","entryId":"89445","definition":"通过教育、经验、思考等来，具备与事物或情况相关的信息或知识。","pronunciation":["알ː다"]},{"id":"dcd19f5b5caac977","term":"수","zh":"可以，可能","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3","entryId":"15615","definition":"做某事的能力，或某事发生的可能性。","pronunciation":["수"]},{"id":"815560dcd5b82893","term":"없다","zh":"不能（-ㄹ/을 수 없다）","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3","entryId":"89917","definition":"不能（-ㄹ/을 수 없다）","pronunciation":["업ː따"]}],"audio":"/audio/d2756da21eaa88727574.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n73140-2-7-2","ko":"내 자리를 걸고서라도 범인을 반드시 잡아내고 말겠어.","zh":"就算赌上自己的职位，我也要一定要抓住凶手。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"내","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"자리를","meaning":"位，位子","explanation":"자리：位，位子；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"자리","audio":"/audio/0f4adfe312e61750897c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60332","senseId":"4","lemma":"자리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"걸고서라도","meaning":"豁出，以……为担保","explanation":"걸다：豁出，以……为担保；고서：表示前一动作完成以后再进行后一动作。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；라도：表示让步或假定：“即使是、就算是”。","readings":[{"term":"걸다","audio":"/audio/a44925f8d8720a550d7d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65528","senseId":"12","lemma":"걸다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"범인을","meaning":"犯人，罪犯","explanation":"범인：犯人，罪犯；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"범인","audio":"/audio/29d23f06ebca35bda654.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14455","senseId":"1","lemma":"범인","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"반드시","meaning":"一定，必须","explanation":"반드시：一定，必须","readings":[{"term":"반드시","audio":"/audio/fcea2b562aa3175866f7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"56794","senseId":"1","lemma":"반드시","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"잡아내고","meaning":"揪出来，拉出来","explanation":"잡아내다：揪出来，拉出来；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"잡아내다","audio":"/audio/2c254665bd49df70a317.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73140","senseId":"2","lemma":"잡아내다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"말겠어.","meaning":"结果还是、最终发生（-고 말다）","explanation":"말다：结果还是、最终发生（-고 말다）；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"말다","audio":"/audio/f8b54c8d9bfb2043a3b8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72580","senseId":"3","lemma":"말다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"0f4adfe312e61750","term":"자리","zh":"位，位子","audio":"/audio/0f4adfe312e61750897c.mp3","entryId":"60332","definition":"在组织里的职位或地位。","pronunciation":["자리"]},{"id":"a44925f8d8720a55","term":"걸다","zh":"豁出，以……为担保","audio":"/audio/a44925f8d8720a550d7d.mp3","entryId":"65528","definition":"以性命、名誉等作为担保，或为了实现什么目的已做好牺牲的准备。","pronunciation":["걸ː다"]},{"id":"29d23f06ebca35bd","term":"범인","zh":"犯人，罪犯","audio":"/audio/29d23f06ebca35bda654.mp3","entryId":"14455","definition":"违反法律、犯了错误的人。","pronunciation":["버ː민"]},{"id":"fcea2b562aa31758","term":"반드시","zh":"一定，必须","audio":"/audio/fcea2b562aa3175866f7.mp3","entryId":"56794","definition":"确定无疑，务必。","pronunciation":["반드시"]},{"id":"2c254665bd49df70","term":"잡아내다","zh":"揪出来，拉出来","audio":"/audio/2c254665bd49df70a317.mp3","entryId":"73140","definition":"将躲藏起来的人或东西等找出来。","pronunciation":["자바내다"]},{"id":"f8b54c8d9bfb2043","term":"말다","zh":"结果还是、最终发生（-고 말다）","audio":"/audio/f8b54c8d9bfb2043a3b8.mp3","entryId":"72580","definition":"结果还是、最终发生（-고 말다）","pronunciation":["말ː다"]}],"audio":"/audio/862c0a7df2afb627ef8c.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.553,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=73140","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"고급","day":172,"sequenceScore":3.3797,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["我不知道凶手躲去了哪里。","就算赌上自己的职位，我也要一定要抓住凶手。","最近商店都是把类似的商品放在一起陈列的。"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["我不知道凶手躲去了哪里。","就算赌上自己的职位，我也要一定要抓住凶手。","最近商店都是把类似的商品放在一起陈列的。"],"answer":1}]}
